{"3588410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Jacob's Ladder", "steam_appid": 3588410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DO NOT BE AFRAID</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the derelict domain of The Maker - a powerful and misguided zealot whose dreams become your nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the path. Continue the work. Do not tarry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: While Jacob’s Ladder features unsettling environments and sequences, it is not a hardcore horror game and currently contains no jumpscares.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU ARE THE SOLUTION</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap bodies with other testing units to solve intriguing puzzles in first-person.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change your identity to use intuitive tools such as two-way phase fields.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >C.O.R.E. CONCEPTS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate the environment by stacking and placing precious C.O.R.E. units.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use cores to give life to other testing units - and when no longer needed, take it away.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness unique abilities from cores to creatively navigate trials.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DO NOT BE AFRAID</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the derelict domain of The Maker - a powerful and misguided zealot whose dreams become your nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the path. Continue the work. Do not tarry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: While Jacob’s Ladder features unsettling environments and sequences, it is not a hardcore horror game and currently contains no jumpscares.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU ARE THE SOLUTION</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap bodies with other testing units to solve intriguing puzzles in first-person.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change your identity to use intuitive tools such as two-way phase fields.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >C.O.R.E. CONCEPTS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate the environment by stacking and placing precious C.O.R.E. units.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use cores to give life to other testing units - and when no longer needed, take it away.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness unique abilities from cores to creatively navigate trials.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Jacob’s Ladder is a haunting first-person puzzler where YOU are the solution. Swap bodies and stack puzzle pieces to please The Maker. Question the nature of the soul and earn your humanity - before it’s too late.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588410/cdd786168dc49ef75ab3083db186e5a8bf6aa934/header.jpg?t=1775000700", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588410/339844477fa643d628309fb2fbb93457b8a405ce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775000700", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588410/339844477fa643d628309fb2fbb93457b8a405ce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775000700", "website": "https://earthlightgames.org/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 version 21H1 (build 19043) or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86, x64 architecture with SSE2 instruction set support, Arm64<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DX10, DX11, DX12 or Vulkan capable GPUs<b